:: PassageFooter
<hr>
<div class="statusbar">体力：$player.hp / $player.maxHp　｜　背包：<<= setup.RPG.inventoryLabel()>></div>

:: StoryStylesheet
body {
	background: #14141c;
	color: #d8d4c8;
	font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
}
#passages {
	max-width: 38em;
	margin: 3em auto;
	padding: 0 1em;
}
a {
	color: #e8c874;
}
a:hover {
	color: #fff0c0;
}
hr {
	border: 0;
	border-top: 1px solid #3a3a48;
}
.statusbar {
	color: #7fa0b8;
	font-size: 0.9em;
}
.choice-box {
	margin: 0.6em 0;
}
.choice-box button {
	display: inline-block;
	margin: 0.25em 0.8em 0.25em 0;
}
small {
	color: #8a8a96;
}
